WEBVTT

00:03:27.354 --> 00:03:31.125
And you see that the operation
rate in Møre og Romsdal

00:03:31.149 --> 00:03:34.834
is five times the operation
rate in Stavanger.

00:03:35.427 --> 00:03:36.775
Five times.

00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:38.418
How can this be?

00:03:38.442 --> 00:03:40.424
Did the soccer players in Møre og Romsdal

00:03:40.448 --> 00:03:42.599
play more dirty
than elsewhere in the country?

00:03:42.623 --> 00:03:44.265
(Laughter)

00:03:44.815 --> 00:03:45.965
Probably not.

00:03:47.109 --> 00:03:49.268
I added some information now.

00:03:49.292 --> 00:03:51.442
What you see now
is the procedures performed

00:03:51.466 --> 00:03:53.498
in public hospitals, in light blue,

00:03:53.522 --> 00:03:56.506
the ones in private clinics
are light green.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:59.880
There is a lot of activity
in the private clinics

00:03:59.904 --> 00:04:01.837
in Møre og Romsdal, isn't there?